docs {
  # List Expense Attachments

  **Method:** `GET`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/expense/:expense_id`
  **Auth:** None (Public)

  ## Description

  Retrieves all attachments tied to a specific expense (such as receipt images, PDF invoices, and payment confirmations).

  ## Request

  ### URL Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `expense_id` | `int64` | Yes | Target expense ID |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 12,
        "uploaded_by_user_id": 1,
        "expense_id": 1,
        "type": "EXPENSE_RECEIPT",
        "original_filename": "supermarket_receipt.jpg",
        "object_key": "attachments/expense_receipt/2026/11/supermarket_receipt.jpg",
        "access_url": "http://127.0.0.1:9000/doratou-storage/attachments/expense_receipt/2026/11/supermarket_receipt.jpg?...",
        "is_public": false,
        "created_at": "2026-11-09T17:00:00Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-11-09T17:00:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
